<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Voucher Gratis Ongkir - MATCHPASS</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: rgb(245, 247, 244);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: rgb(20, 29, 22);
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    "
  >
    <table
      role="presentation"
      width="100%"
      cellspacing="0"
      cellpadding="0"
      style="background-color: rgb(245, 247, 244); padding: 40px 20px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            width="100%"
            cellspacing="0"
            cellpadding="0"
            style="
              max-width: 600px;
              background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
              border: 1px solid rgb(214, 224, 216);
              border-radius: 16px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(20, 29, 22, 0.06);
            "
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 32px 32px 24px;
                  border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(214, 224, 216);
                  text-align: left;
                  background:
                    linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 94, 52, 0.08), rgba(210, 82, 32, 0.08));
                "
              >
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 8px;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    letter-spacing: 1px;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                    color: rgb(92, 105, 95);
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  MATCHPASS
                </p>
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    line-height: 1.15;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    color: rgb(20, 29, 22);
                  "
                >
                  Voucher Gratis Ongkir untukmu!
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 36px 32px 32px">
                <h2
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 22px;
                    line-height: 1.3;
                    color: rgb(20, 29, 22);
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  Hi {{name}},
                </h2>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 24px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: rgb(92, 105, 95);
                  "
                >
                  Sebagai reward referral, kamu mendapatkan voucher gratis ongkos kirim 100%.
                  Gunakan kode di bawah ini saat checkout. Berlaku selama 30 hari.
                </p>

                <table
                  role="presentation"
                  width="100%"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  style="
                    background-color: rgb(236, 241, 236);
                    border: 2px dashed rgb(34, 94, 52);
                    border-radius: 12px;
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                  "
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 24px; text-align: center">
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0 0 8px;
                          font-size: 13px;
                          letter-spacing: 1px;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                          color: rgb(92, 105, 95);
                          font-weight: 700;
                        "
                      >
                        Kode Voucher Ongkir Kamu
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0;
                          font-size: 28px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          color: rgb(34, 94, 52);
                          letter-spacing: 4px;
                          font-family: monospace;
                        "
                      >
                        {{voucherCode}}
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <table
                  role="presentation"
                  width="100%"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  style="
                    background-color: rgb(253, 246, 241);
                    border: 1px solid rgb(210, 82, 32);
                    border-radius: 12px;
                  "
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 18px">
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0 0 8px;
                          font-size: 14px;
                          line-height: 1.5;
                          color: rgb(20, 29, 22);
                          font-weight: 700;
                        "
                      >
                        Syarat & Ketentuan
                      </p>
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0;
                          font-size: 14px;
                          line-height: 1.7;
                          color: rgb(92, 105, 95);
                        "
                      >
                        Voucher berlaku 30 hari sejak diterima. Diskon 100% untuk ongkos kirim.
                        Satu kali penggunaan dan tidak dapat digabungkan dengan promo lain.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 20px 32px;
                  border-top: 1px solid rgb(214, 224, 216);
                  background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
                  text-align: center;
                "
              >
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    color: rgb(92, 105, 95);
                  "
                >
                  Email ini dikirim oleh MATCHPASS sebagai reward program referral.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
